## Interface: 16001, 11507, 11508, 11509
## Title: RXP Tag Macros
## Notes: Keeps two macros, RXPTag and RXPMelee, pointed at the mobs of your current RestedXP guide step. RXPTag casts your class's instant tag spell; RXPMelee auto-attacks. /rxptag for options.
## Author: Andres
## Version: 1.0
## Dependencies: RXPGuides
